# COMPONENT

## SimpleEntityViewSample

### PACKAGE

org.sample.simpleentityview

### DESCRIPTION

Dedicated view/read-model sample for an `ENTITY` that extends `SimpleEntity`.

### SPECIFICATION

This component demonstrates that the default `ENTITY > VIEW` surface also works when the concrete entity inherits common view-facing fields from `SimpleEntity`.
The runtime line stays the same as `10-view`: load and search are driven through the generated view service.

# ENTITY

## SimpleEntity

### DESCRIPTION

Shared view-facing base entity.

### ATTRIBUTE

| name  | type     | multiplicity |
|-------+----------+--------------|
| id    | entityid | 1            |
| name  | name     | 1            |
| title | string   | 1            |

## Person

### features

extends = ["SimpleEntity"]

### DESCRIPTION

Person record whose concrete entity extends `SimpleEntity`.

### ATTRIBUTE

| name  | type   | multiplicity |
|-------+--------+--------------|
| city  | string | 1            |

### VIEW

#### DESCRIPTION

Read-model view for loading and searching people whose core fields are inherited from `SimpleEntity`.

#### ATTRIBUTE

| name  | type     | multiplicity |
|-------+----------+--------------|
| id    | entityid | 1            |
| name  | name     | 1            |
| city  | string   | 1            |
| title | string   | 1            |
